# Optional direct access that skips Cloudflare (server/src/direct.rs): the desktop app falls back to it when the main
# address is unreachable (some ISPs block Cloudflare's shared IPs), and invite links on either address work.
# Set your instance's values in app/.env.production.local (gitignored; Vite reads it after this file).
VITE_DIRECT_SERVER=
# Addresses this server used to have, comma-separated: invite and message links to them in old messages are still
# recognized, and a desktop app that saved one as its server goes back to the default.
VITE_FORMER_SERVERS=
